{"id":"574e25d8730366f0","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-alexander-polynomial.md","title":"Normalized Alexander Determinant","display":"df-alexander-polynomial — Normalized Alexander Determinant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-alexander-polynomial","aliases":["58-df-alexander-polynomial"],"display":"df-alexander-polynomial — Normalized Alexander Determinant","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-alexander-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-alexander-polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-alexander-polynomial — Normalized Alexander Determinant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-alexander-polynomial-—-Alexander-Polynomial\">df-alexander-polynomial — Alexander Polynomial</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\omega\">\\(g\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\})\\)</span> (有限支撑系数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\det:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb C^{n\\times n}\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\det:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb C^{n\\times n}\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^T\">\\((-)^T\\)</span> (标准有限矩阵行列式与转置)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (本文件定义的矩阵规范化关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alexander\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S(\\Delta,A,g)\\leftrightarrow g\\in\\omega\\land A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}\\land\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Biggl(\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\varepsilon z^{-g}\\det(zA-A^T)\\Bigr)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)=1\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^{-k}\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alexander\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S(\\Delta,A,g)\\leftrightarrow g\\in\\omega\\land A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}\\land\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Biggl(\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\varepsilon z^{-g}\\det(zA-A^T)\\Bigr)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)=1\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^{-k}\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子把 Laurent 多项式直接编码为有限支撑系数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\Delta:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是某纽结的 Seifert 矩阵，该值给出该纽结的对称规范化 Alexander 多项式。</li>\n<li>因知识库中尚无 Seifert 矩阵与纽结的正式关联谓词，本定义不把未声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 参数伪装进断言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-alexander-polynomial-—-Alexander-Polynomial","text":"df-alexander-polynomial — Alexander Polynomial","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}$ 且 $\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\})$ (有限支撑系数函数, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}$ 且 $\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\})$ (有限支撑系数函数, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\det:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathbb C^{n\\times n}\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"(-)^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alexander\\text{-}polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlexanderPolynomial}_S(\\Delta,A,g)\\leftrightarrow g\\in\\omega\\land A\\in\\mathbb Z^{(2g)\\times(2g)}\\land\\Delta\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{k\\in\\mathbb Z:\\Delta(k)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;\\Biggl(\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\varepsilon z^{-g}\\det(zA-A^T)\\Bigr)\\land\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)=1\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^k=\\sum_{k\\in\\mathbb Z}\\Delta(k)z^{-k}\\Bigr)\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1781,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-alexander-polynomial.md|58-df-alexander-polynomial]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751"]}